       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CALCULATE-SERVICE-FEE.

DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.

01 LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE PIC X.
01 LK-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
01 LK-SERVICE-FEE PIC 9(7)V99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE
    LK-AMOUNT
    LK-SERVICE-FEE.

    MOVE ZERO TO LK-SERVICE-FEE

    IF LK-TRANSACTION-TYPE = "D"
        COMPUTE LK-SERVICE-FEE =
            LK-AMOUNT * 0.01
        ON SIZE ERROR
            MOVE ZERO TO LK-SERVICE-FEE
    END-COMPUTE
    END-IF

    GOBACK.

END PROGRAM CALCULATE-SERVICE-FEE.
